// A child in a group of its own starts a grandchild that sleeps, and says so: kill
// ends both.
// The child is tests/helpers/child.ctx, as `start_beat PATH stay`: it starts a grandchild
// that makes the file PATH grow for a minute, prints `started` and sleeps for a minute. That
// the grandchild has ended is the file no longer growing (`ends PATH`).
//# build child: {home}/tests/helpers/child.ctx
//# build program: main.ctx
//# make dir beat
//# $ {program} {child} beat/file
//# timeout: 30
//# exit: 0
//# stdout:
//| true
//| started
//| 137
//# $ {child} ends beat/file
//# exit: 0
//# stdout:
//| ended
